  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "銀色で　高級感　ただよう　ピック。刺せば　ゴージャスな　気持ちになり苦手な食材も　モリモリ　食べられるはず。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "은색으로 고급스러움을 드러내는 픽. 꽂으면 고저스한 느낌이 들어서 싫어하는 식재료도 잘 먹을 수 있게 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "散發出高檔氣息的銀色小籤。插入三明治時會備感尊榮，即使是不敢吃的食材應該也能大快朵頤。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pique argentée pour pique-niqueurs de luxe. Plantée dans un Sandwich, elle lui donne un côté somptueux qui met en appétit, même si on n’aime pas la garniture.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diesen silbernen Pikser umweht ein Hauch von Luxus. Er veredelt jedes Sandwich und macht sogar Appetit auf Zutaten, die einem normalerweise nicht munden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un palillo de un ostentoso color plateado. Convierte cualquier bocadillo en un plato de lujo tan apetecible que se come aunque no guste su relleno.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Stecchino argentato di alta classe. Dona un tocco di sontuosità al panino, invogliando a mangiarlo di gusto anche se gli ingredienti non vanno molto a genio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A silver pick that oozes class. Using it on a sandwich lends an extravagant air that’ll make you want to eat up, even if you don’t love the fillings.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "銀色で　高級感　ただよう　ピック。刺せば　ゴージャスな　気持ちになり苦手な食材も　モリモリ　食べられるはず。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "充满高档气息的银色签子。插了它就能让人感受到奢华的感觉，连不喜欢的食材应该也能大口吃下。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
